<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Swiss market index.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Swiss market index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued 12 million American-style call and put warrants, in 12 equal tranches, on the Swiss market index, lead manager Citibank (Switzerland) said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS	STRIKE	ISS PRICE	MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A	  4,200.0     2.05 CHF	 16.JUL.97</p>
<p> PUT B	   4,200.0     1.71 CHF	 16.JUL.97</p>
<p> CALL C	  4,400.0     1.11 CHF	 16.JUL.97</p>
<p> PUT D	   4,400.0     2.78 CHF	 16.JUL.97</p>
<p> CALL E	  4,300.0     2.35 CHF	 18.DEC.97</p>
<p> PUT F	   4,300.0     2.87 CHF	 18.DEC.97</p>
<p> CALL G	  4,000.0     4.96 CHF	 13.JUL.98</p>
<p> PUT H	   4,000.0     2.32 CHF	 13.JUL.98</p>
<p> CALL I	  4,200.0     3.76 CHF	 13.JUL.98</p>
<p> PUT J	   4,200.0     3.11 CHF	 13.JUL.98</p>
<p> CALL K	  4,400.0     2.76 CHF	 13.JUL.98</p>
<p> PUT L	   4,400.0     4.09 CHF	 13.JUL.98</p>
<p> PAYDATE 10.FEB.97     LISTING *SWISS SE     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> NOTES	     *FOR WARRANTS EXPIRING DEC 1997 AND JUL 1998</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
